{%- comment -%}
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Planet Beauty — Tag-based product message (parity with live "tag_base" block).

  Shows a short message under the product title when the product carries a given
  tag (e.g. tag "No Returnable item" -> final-sale message). Add one block per
  tag/message pair in the theme editor, exactly like the live store.

  Live-configured pairs (for reference):
    - "SALE"               -> "no coupons can be applied to this item"
    - "No Returnable item" -> "Final sale: Refunds are only available for sealed,
                                unopened items returned within 30 days. ..."
    - "Limited Shipping"   -> "Maximum order allowed of 6 per customer per month"

  Product card tags (see snippets/product-card-badges.liquid):
    - "label:new"  -> pink "new" badge on collection/home cards
    - "label:sale" -> mint "sale" badge on collection/home cards

  Recharge subscription-only (see snippets/pb-recharge-widget.liquid):
    - "subscriptiononly" -> hides one-time purchase option on PDP
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign pb_product = closest.product | default: product
-%}
{%- if block.settings.tag != blank and pb_product.tags contains block.settings.tag -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    pb a11y (WCAG 1.4.1 Use of Colour): these messages are purchase-affecting
    ("Final sale", "Max 6 per customer"). Live conveyed that weight with red
    text alone; the visually-hidden "Important:" prefix gives screen-reader
    users the same signal without changing the visual design.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="pb-tag-message" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'accessibility.important_note' | t | default: 'Important:' }}</span>
    {{- block.settings.message -}}
  </span>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Matches the live theme's .custom-message styling.
     pb a11y (WCAG 1.4.3 AA): live used `red` (#ff0000), which is 4.00:1 on
     white — under the 4.5:1 required at 12px bold. #d40000 is 5.53:1 and reads
     as the same warning red. */
  .pb-tag-message {
    color: #d40000;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 12px;
    display: block;
    line-height: 14px;
  }
  /* Small gap so stacked messages (and the SKU above) don't collide. */
  .pb-tag-message + .pb-tag-message {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Tag message",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tag",
      "label": "Product tag",
      "info": "Message shows only when the product has this exact tag."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "message",
      "label": "Message"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Tag message"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
